{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年35歲的前港姐冠軍陳凱琳（Grace），自2018年與視帝鄭嘉穎結婚後先後誕下三名兒子，一家五口向來幸福美滿。</p><p>婚後的陳凱琳並未淡出幕前，反而成功轉型為吸金力極強的人氣KOL，並兼顧自家朱古力生意。</p><p>早前她更北上參與內地綜藝節目《乘風202</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:15:31.255338+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:08:54.923027+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:08:54.923027+00:00","content_hash":"2601e1f42fc7f301bb75e67e647e0de8f6962d1fecb06fb4fa73228a44b380fb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}